---
import "@fontsource/instrument-serif/400-italic.css"
---

<section class="bento-wrap" aria-labelledby="revision-title">
  <h2 id="revision-title">Qué se revisa para que <em>te encuentren</em></h2>

  <div class="bento">
    <article class="tile t-ficha">
      <svg viewBox="0 40 360 150" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M44 120c-12-12-24-22-24-36a24 24 0 0 1 48 0c0 14-12 24-24 36z" class="signal"></path>
        <circle cx="44" cy="84" r="8" class="signal"></circle>
        <rect x="92" y="52" width="130" height="14" rx="7"></rect>
        <rect x="92" y="76" width="96" height="10" rx="5" class="soft"></rect>
        <rect x="236" y="46" width="112" height="30" rx="15" class="signal"></rect>
        <text x="292" y="67" text-anchor="middle" class="label">Categoría</text>
        <circle cx="104" cy="118" r="10"></circle>
        <path d="M104 111v7l5 3"></path>
        <rect x="124" y="113" width="110" height="10" rx="5" class="soft"></rect>
        <rect x="20" y="152" width="84" height="26" rx="13"></rect>
        <rect x="114" y="152" width="96" height="26" rx="13"></rect>
        <rect x="220" y="152" width="76" height="26" rx="13"></rect>
        <path d="M322 160l5 5 10-10" class="signal"></path>
      </svg>
      <h3>Ficha de Google</h3>
      <p>Categoría, servicios, horarios, descripción y señales visibles, revisados para que expliquen bien lo que haces.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile t-dir">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 188" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <rect x="8" y="8" width="304" height="38" rx="8"></rect>
        <text x="22" y="33" class="label">Misma dirección</text>
        <circle cx="284" cy="27" r="10" class="signal"></circle>
        <path d="M279 27l3.5 3.5 6-6.5" class="signal"></path>
        <rect x="8" y="54" width="304" height="38" rx="8"></rect>
        <text x="22" y="79" class="label">Mismo teléfono</text>
        <circle cx="284" cy="73" r="10" class="signal"></circle>
        <path d="M279 73l3.5 3.5 6-6.5" class="signal"></path>
        <rect x="8" y="100" width="304" height="38" rx="8"></rect>
        <text x="22" y="125" class="label">Mismo nombre</text>
        <circle cx="284" cy="119" r="10" class="signal"></circle>
        <path d="M279 119l3.5 3.5 6-6.5" class="signal"></path>
        <rect x="8" y="146" width="304" height="34" rx="8" class="soft"></rect>
        <rect x="22" y="159" width="120" height="8" rx="4" class="soft"></rect>
      </svg>
      <h3>Datos coherentes en directorios</h3>
      <p>Que nombre, dirección y teléfono coincidan en los lugares públicos donde la gente consulta tu negocio.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile t-busq">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <rect x="8" y="8" width="304" height="40" rx="20" class="signal"></rect>
        <circle cx="32" cy="28" r="7" class="signal"></circle>
        <path d="M37 33l6 6" class="signal"></path>
        <text x="54" y="34" class="label strong">fontanero cerca de mí</text>
        <rect x="8" y="60" width="304" height="232" rx="10"></rect>
        <path d="M8 160c50-30 90 20 150-8s100-14 154-6" class="soft"></path>
        <path d="M120 60c-8 60 18 100 8 232" class="soft"></path>
        <path d="M220 60c10 50-12 90 6 232" class="soft"></path>
        <path d="M70 150c-6-7-10-12-10-17a10 10 0 0 1 20 0c0 5-4 10-10 17z" class="signal"></path>
        <path d="M170 210c-6-7-10-12-10-17a10 10 0 0 1 20 0c0 5-4 10-10 17z" class="signal"></path>
        <path d="M260 250c-6-7-10-12-10-17a10 10 0 0 1 20 0c0 5-4 10-10 17z" class="signal"></path>
        <path d="M240 110c-6-7-10-12-10-17a10 10 0 0 1 20 0c0 5-4 10-10 17z" class="signal"></path>
      </svg>
      <h3>Búsquedas locales</h3>
      <p>Cómo explicar tus servicios y zonas con las palabras que usa tu cliente cuando busca cerca.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile t-op">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 130" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <polygon points="24 12 28 22 38 23 31 30 33 40 24 35 15 40 17 30 10 23 20 22" class="signal"></polygon>
        <polygon points="64 12 68 22 78 23 71 30 73 40 64 35 55 40 57 30 50 23 60 22" class="signal"></polygon>
        <polygon points="104 12 108 22 118 23 111 30 113 40 104 35 95 40 97 30 90 23 100 22" class="signal"></polygon>
        <polygon points="144 12 148 22 158 23 151 30 153 40 144 35 135 40 137 30 130 23 140 22" class="signal"></polygon>
        <polygon points="184 12 188 22 198 23 191 30 193 40 184 35 175 40 177 30 170 23 180 22" class="signal"></polygon>
        <rect x="8" y="56" width="190" height="20" rx="10" class="soft"></rect>
        <path d="M30 76l-4 8 12-8" class="soft"></path>
        <rect x="112" y="90" width="196" height="30" rx="12" class="signal"></rect>
        <path d="M280 120l6 8 2-8" class="signal"></path>
        <rect x="128" y="100" width="120" height="8" rx="4" class="signal"></rect>
      </svg>
      <h3>Opiniones</h3>
      <p>Un proceso para pedir reseñas auténticas y responderlas, sin atajos.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile t-web">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 130" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <rect x="8" y="8" width="196" height="114" rx="10"></rect>
        <path d="M8 30h196"></path>
        <circle cx="22" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle>
        <circle cx="34" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle>
        <circle cx="46" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle>
        <rect x="22" y="42" width="110" height="12" rx="6" class="signal"></rect>
        <rect x="22" y="64" width="162" height="8" rx="4" class="soft"></rect>
        <rect x="22" y="80" width="140" height="8" rx="4" class="soft"></rect>
        <rect x="22" y="96" width="90" height="14" rx="7"></rect>
        <rect x="222" y="44" width="90" height="38" rx="19" class="signal"></rect>
        <text x="267" y="69" text-anchor="middle" class="label">datos</text>
      </svg>
      <h3>Web clara</h3>
      <p>Qué conviene aclarar en la web para que personas y buscadores entiendan qué ofreces y dónde.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile t-med">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 150" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M8 120h304"></path>
        <rect x="24" y="44" width="56" height="76" rx="6" class="signal"></rect>
        <text x="52" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="label">llamadas</text>
        <rect x="132" y="74" width="56" height="46" rx="6" class="signal"></rect>
        <text x="160" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="label">clics</text>
        <rect x="240" y="20" width="56" height="100" rx="6" class="signal"></rect>
        <text x="268" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="label">rutas</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="tile-text">
        <h3>Medición</h3>
        <p>Qué acciones se pueden observar, como llamadas, clics y rutas, para decidir el siguiente paso.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="bento-caption">Ejemplo ilustrativo</p>
</section>

<style>
  .bento-wrap {
    color: rgb(226 232 240);
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: white;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  h2 em {
    color: rgb(125 211 252);
    font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.12em;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .bento-wrap h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .bento-caption {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: rgb(148 163 184);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .bento-caption::before {
    content: "";
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgb(51 65 85);
  }

  .bento {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .tile {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(51 65 85);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    background: rgb(8 15 32);
  }

  .tile svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: rgb(148 163 184);
  }

  .tile :global(.signal) {
    stroke: rgb(56 189 248);
  }

  .tile :global(.soft) {
    stroke: rgb(71 85 105);
  }

  .tile :global(.label) {
    fill: rgb(203 213 225);
    stroke: none;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .tile :global(.strong) {
    fill: white;
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .tile p {
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: rgb(203 213 225);
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .t-med .tile-text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .t-busq {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .t-ficha,
    .t-med {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .t-med {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .t-med svg {
      flex: 1 1 55%;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .t-med .tile-text {
      flex: 1 1 45%;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
      grid-template-areas:
        "ficha ficha ficha ficha dir dir"
        "busq busq op op op op"
        "busq busq web web web web"
        "med med med med med med";
    }

    .t-ficha { grid-area: ficha; }
    .t-dir { grid-area: dir; }
    .t-busq { grid-area: busq; }
    .t-op { grid-area: op; }
    .t-web { grid-area: web; }
    .t-med { grid-area: med; }

    .t-ficha svg {
      max-height: 15rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .tile { padding: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
